### DocExtract — Ingest e2e requests
### Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Prerequisites: see e2e/README.md

@host = http://localhost:8080
@contextPath = /adeon-docextract
@baseUrl = {{host}}{{contextPath}}
# dvelop-mock's identityprovider-validate.json accepts any bearer token.
@authHeader = Bearer {{$processEnv DMS_TEST_TOKEN}}

### Test Authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents/test
Authorization: {{authHeader}}


### Upload a native PDF — direct chunk upload, no Gotenberg render.
# @name uploadPdf
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----docextractE2E

------docextractE2E
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/invoice.pdf
------docextractE2E--

### Stream the preview of the PDF just uploaded (previewLocation == dmsLocation). 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents/{{uploadPdf.response.body.$.originalBlobId}}/preview
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

### Upload a non-PDF — rendered via Gotenberg into a separate, unfinalized preview chunk.
# @name uploadLetter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----docextractE2E

------docextractE2E
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="letter.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./fixtures/letter.txt
------docextractE2E--

### Stream the Gotenberg-rendered preview (previewLocation != dmsLocation here).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents/{{uploadLetter.response.body.$.originalBlobId}}/preview
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

### No credential on the request — expect 401 (nothing to replay to the DMS).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----docextractE2E

------docextractE2E
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/invoice.pdf
------docextractE2E--

### Upload exceeding docextract.ingest.max-file-size-bytes — expect 400 "Upload rejected".
### Lower the limit for this run, e.g. DOCEXTRACT_INGEST_MAX_FILE_SIZE_BYTES=10
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----docextractE2E

------docextractE2E
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/invoice.pdf
------docextractE2E--
